free-form oper-ational data into governed, structured, and
decision-ready information. The design also supports traceability. At
every major step, records preserve source identity, timestamps, hashes,
provenance metadata, and processing outputs. This is important because
oper-ational intelligence is valuable only when its origin and
transformation history can be inspected.

